---
/**
 * valuecreationprotocol.com — placeholder index
 *
 * FR-1 scaffold: repo and infrastructure only.
 * FR-4 (site shell + navigation) will be built by Showcase in a subsequent session.
 *
 * This page exists so Vercel has something to deploy.
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Value Creation Protocol</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="The Value Creation Protocol (VCP) is an open framework for designing systems where value flows naturally between people, organizations, and AI."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://valuecreationprotocol.com/" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        background: #fafaf9;
        color: #1c1917;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 640px;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #0d9488;
        border: 1px solid #0d9488;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
        color: #0c0a09;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1.0625rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #44403c;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      }
      .note {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        background: #f5f5f4;
        border-left: 3px solid #a8a29e;
        border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        color: #78716c;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="badge">Open Protocol</div>
      <h1>Value Creation Protocol</h1>
      <p>
        An open framework for designing systems where value flows naturally
        between people, organizations, and AI — independent of any firm engagement.
      </p>
      <p>
        Canonical home for the Value-First methodology. A peer to
        modelcontextprotocol.io and humancontextprotocol.com in the
        AI-native protocol stack.
      </p>
      <div class="note">
        Site build in progress. Full protocol documentation arriving shortly.
        Canonically implemented at
        <a href="https://valuefirstteam.com" style="color: #0d9488;">valuefirstteam.com</a>.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
